mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.800em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\texttt{MLLM}(\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l1.9" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;"> (can be the same as </span><span id="alg1.l1.10" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">LLM</span><span id="alg1.l1.11" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;"> if it handles multimodal inputs), max number of rounds </span><math id="alg1.l1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.800em">T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l1.12" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">, (optionally) early-stop patience </span><math id="alg1.l1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.800em">m</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l1.13" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">.
