          <span id="alg1.l8.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">   </span><span id="alg1.l8.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;">(§<a href="#S3.SS4" title="3.4 User Intent Grounding via Self-Verification (Block 10) ‣ 3 Methodology ‣ Maestro: Self-Improving Text-to-Image Generation via Agent Orchestration" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.4</span></a>)</span><span id="alg1.l8.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;"> Refine and self-correct prompt proposals to ensure grounding on original user intent: </span><math id="alg1.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p^{(t)}\leftarrow\texttt{Refine}_{\texttt{LLM}}(p^{(t)},Q)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathsize="0.800em">p</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.800em">t</mi><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo mathsize="0.800em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathsize="0.800em">Refine</mtext><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathsize="0.800em">LLM</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">(</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.800em">p</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.800em">t</mi><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo mathsize="0.800em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.800em">Q</mi><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p^{(t)}\leftarrow\texttt{Refine}_{\texttt{LLM}}(p^{(t)},Q)</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l8.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">.
</span>
</div>
