<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A2.T3.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 3</span>: </span><span id="A2.T3.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Additional qualitative examples of the image trajectories generated by <span id="A2.T3.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Maestro</span>. Refer to Table <a href="#S4.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ Maestro: Self-Improving Text-to-Image Generation via Agent Orchestration" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> for additional explanations.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
